; waifu.fun DNS Zone File
; Give this to Shaw — he just needs to add these records at his registrar
; Or better: point nameservers to Cloudflare for free SSL/CDN/DDoS
;
; Last updated: 2026-03-08

$TTL 300

; ──────────────────────────────────────
; Frontend (Vercel)
; ──────────────────────────────────────
waifu.fun.            A       76.76.21.21
www.waifu.fun.        CNAME   cname.vercel-dns.com.

; ──────────────────────────────────────
; Backend API (Hetzner VPS)
; ──────────────────────────────────────
api.waifu.fun.        A       89.167.63.246

; ──────────────────────────────────────
; Optional: email (prevents spam spoofing)
; ──────────────────────────────────────
waifu.fun.            MX      10 mail.waifu.fun.
waifu.fun.            TXT     "v=spf1 -all"
_dmarc.waifu.fun.     TXT     "v=DMARC1; p=reject; sp=reject"
